1
00:00:00,243 --> 00:00:01,473
(Howard:)Where are the guys?

2
00:00:01,678 --> 00:00:02,768
(Bernadette:)Oh, it's just me.

3
00:00:03,113 --> 00:00:07,173
(Howard:)Oh, I get it. They're waiting, back home,
with a big surprise party.

4
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:08,820
(Howard:)Don't worry.
I can act surprised.

5
00:00:12,522 --> 00:00:14,952
(Bernadette:)No, I told them
they could have you tomorrow night.

6
00:00:15,125 --> 00:00:17,155
(Bernadette:)Tonight, you belong to me.

7
00:00:23,667 --> 00:00:26,697
- Gesundheit. You okay?
- I am now that you're back.

8
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:30,360
(Bernadette:)Come on, let's go home,
so I can tear off those little pants.

9
00:00:30,574 --> 00:00:34,734
(Howard:)Great. Just keep in mind astronauts lose
a lot of muscle tone in space...

10
00:00:34,911 --> 00:00:38,041
(Howard:)...so you might have to do
most of the heavy lifting.

11
00:00:39,583 --> 00:00:42,953
(Sheldon:)Now, I am very disappointed
that I won't be able to celebrate...

12
00:00:43,153 --> 00:00:46,643
(Sheldon:)...Howard's accomplishment tonight.
- Me too, but we'll see him tomorrow.

13
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:49,590
(Sheldon:)Yes, it's just that
in all the years I've known him...

14
00:00:49,759 --> 00:00:53,529
(Sheldon:)...he's never had the opportunity
to receive my admiration.

15
00:00:54,931 --> 00:00:58,761
(Sheldon:)I was excited to see the look
on his face when it finally happened.

16
00:00:59,069 --> 00:01:00,129
(Penny:)You're unbelievable.

